<html>
<title>How do I use the 40th Anniversary Multi-cart?</title>

<body>

<h1>How do I use the 40th Anniversary Multi-cart?</h1>

<p>
To use the 40th Anniversary Multi-cart as designed by FLiP, select one of the <strong>Multi-cart</strong> XML files.
</p>

<p>
At start-up, the currently selected ROM is shown in the title of the Studio II window. Change the ROM by switching MSB or LSB. This will update the Studio II title and restart the system.
</p>

<p>
<strong>Note:</strong> A real Studio II with a multi-cart will NOT restart automatically.
</p>

<p>
Depending on which XML file is selected, the multi-cart will either use the original Studio II ROM or the system ROM (as defined in the multi-cart). The system ROM will, for example, be needed to run the StudioII / Conic / MPT-02 game <strong>Star Wars</strong> correctly (i.e., without part of the screen being missing).
</p>

</body>
</html>

